// ============================================================================
// n8n Code node: "Rules Review Input"   (Mode: Run Once for All Items)
//
// The general reviewer's output replaced the chunk data, so re-emit the chunks
// from "Build Review Context" (same order) for the rules reviewer.
// "Has Repo Rules?" then skips the rules reviewer when hasRules is false.
// ============================================================================
return $('Build Review Context').all().map(i => ({ json: i.json }));

